            <stacked_container x="1308" y="42" height="529" width="414" uid="9">
                <table font-size="12" background="#FFFFC9" column_width="77" orientation="vertical" interval="DT" cleared="true" date_time="2010-12-02T13:30:45Z">
                    <title>Mammoths</title>
                    <item type="time" color="black" precision="max" width="100" />
                    <item color="black" precision="1" delimit_000s="true" index="0">
                        <entity name="Mammoths" />
                    </item>
                    <item color="#7F00FF" precision="1" delimit_000s="true" index="1">
                        <entity name="Game_Score" />
                    </item>
                    <item color="#008F44" precision="0" delimit_000s="true" index="2">
                        <entity name="Survival_Win" />
                    </item>
                </table>
            </stacked_container>
            <pad_icon x="1435" y="218" width="26" height="22" color="#008F44" label_side="bottom" label="Table 1" type="table" icon_of="9" />
            <knob x="116" y="422" color="black" width="83" height="91" min="0" max="100" precision="1">
                <entity name="Mammoths" />
            </knob>
            <button x="471" y="375" width="87" height="43" uid="10" appearance="opaque" background="black" color="white" style="rounded" label="Run" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <menu_action>run</menu_action>
            </button>
            <button x="474" y="438" width="81" height="46" uid="11" appearance="opaque" background="black" color="white" style="rounded" label="Restore Graphs &amp; Tables" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <menu_action>restore_graphs_tables</menu_action>
            </button>
            <slider x="293" y="398" color="#30CB79" width="197" height="43" min="0" max="0.5" precision="0.01">
                <entity name="Birth_Fraction" />
            </slider>
            <slider x="291" y="471" color="red" width="197" height="43" min="0" max="0.5" precision="0.01">
                <entity name="Death_Fraction" />
            </slider>
            <button x="1799" y="292" width="91" height="46" uid="12" appearance="opaque" background="black" color="white" style="rounded" label="View sliders and graph" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="interface" x="0" y="0" />
            </button>
            <button x="617" y="377" width="102" height="40" uid="13" appearance="opaque" background="black" color="white" style="rounded" label="View table" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="next_page" />
            </button>
            <button x="621" y="438" width="100" height="44" uid="14" appearance="opaque" background="black" color="white" style="rounded" label="View challenges 1 and 2" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="interface" x="0" y="952" />
            </button>
            <button x="1514" y="1266" width="98" height="44" uid="15" appearance="opaque" background="black" color="white" style="rounded" label="View sliders and graph" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="interface" x="0" y="0" />
            </button>
            <text_box x="541" y="88" uid="16" color="black" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" padding="5" border-style="solid" border-width="thin" width="401" height="103">1. Set the sliders to replicate the Mammoth Game.&#x0D;2. Experiment with the effect of the different sliders. &#x0D;3. See if you can reproduce the challenges.  What do these challenges mean in the Mammoth Game?</text_box>
            <button x="360" y="1356" width="131" height="34" uid="17" appearance="opaque" background="black" color="white" style="rounded" label="Back to sliders and graph" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="interface" x="0" y="0" />
            </button>
            <text_box x="1349" y="973" uid="18" color="black" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" padding="5" border-style="solid" border-width="thin" width="499" height="253">THE MAMMOTH GAME - STARTING WITH A LARGE HERD&#x0D;&#x0D;In this version of the Mammoth Game, the computer will simulate 20 years in the life of a herd.  Start by replicating the first Mammoth Game - 1/6 probability of birth (about 17%), 2/6 probability of death (about 33%), and an initial population of 20 mammoths.   Run the simulation and see how the computer simulates the game you played with dice.&#x0D;&#x0D;Next you can experiment to see the effect of a larger or smaller starting population.  You can increase the herd up to 100 mammoths.  &#x0D;&#x0D;You may also choose the birth and death fractions.  Since the birth and death fractions define the percentages of the herd that reproduce or die each year, you can test hypotheses and try to match challenge graphs.  Clicking the buttons labeled &apos;u&apos; on the sliders and knob will restore the original values used in the dice simulation.</text_box>
            <button x="629" y="272" width="59" height="58" uid="19" appearance="opaque" background="black" color="white" style="square" icon="5">
                <link target="home_page" isee:default_icon="true" />
            </button>
            <text_box x="159" y="1264" uid="20" color="black" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" padding="5" border-style="solid" border-width="thin" width="553" height="62">                                                       CHALLENGES 1 AND 2&#x0D;Study these graphs.  Then click the &quot;Back to sliders and graph&quot; button to try to run a simulation that matches each of these graphs.</text_box>
            <button x="624" y="504" width="97" height="49" uid="21" appearance="opaque" background="black" color="white" style="rounded" label="View challenges 3 and 4" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="interface" x="0" y="1904" />
            </button>
            <text_box x="268" y="2249" uid="22" color="black" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" padding="5" border-style="solid" border-width="thin" width="394" height="63">                                    CHALLENGES 3 AND 4&#x0D;Study these graphs.  Then click the &quot;Back to sliders and graph&quot; button to try to run a simulation that matches each of these graphs.</text_box>
            <button x="423" y="2340" width="119" height="41" uid="23" appearance="opaque" background="black" color="white" style="rounded" label="Back to sliders and graph" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="interface" x="0" y="0" />
            </button>
            <button x="143" y="1485" width="76" height="53" uid="24" appearance="opaque" background="black" color="white" style="rounded" icon="5">
                <link target="home_page" isee:default_icon="true" />
            </button>
            <button x="270" y="1488" width="103" height="48" uid="25" appearance="opaque" background="black" color="white" style="rounded" label="View challenges 3 and 4" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="interface" x="0" y="1904" />
            </button>
            <button x="139" y="2422" width="72" height="53" uid="26" appearance="opaque" background="black" color="white" style="rounded" icon="5">
                <link target="home_page" isee:default_icon="true" />
            </button>
            <button x="258" y="2423" width="93" height="51" uid="27" appearance="opaque" background="black" color="white" style="rounded" label="View challenges 1 and 2" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="interface" x="0" y="952" />
            </button>
            <text_box x="25" y="340" uid="29" color="black" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" padding="5" border-style="solid" border-width="thin" width="230" height="57">Starting herd: choose how many mammoths begin the round.</text_box>
            <text_box x="270" y="342" uid="30" color="black" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" padding="5" border-style="solid" border-width="thin" width="210" height="47">Birth chance</text_box>
            <text_box x="270" y="445" uid="31" color="black" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" padding="5" border-style="solid" border-width="thin" width="210" height="47">Death chance</text_box>
            <text_box x="759" y="360" uid="32" color="#7F00FF" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" padding="5" border-style="solid" border-width="thin" width="207" height="149">GAME GOAL&#x0D;&#x0D;After 20 years, keep at least 10 mammoths alive and get as close as you can to the target herd of 40. A higher score means your herd ended closer to the target.</text_box>
            <numeric_display precision="1" display_as="number" color="#7F00FF" show_name="true" retain_ending_value="true" uid="33" x="768" y="529">
                <entity name="Game_Score" />
            </numeric_display>
            <numeric_display precision="0" display_as="number" color="#008F44" show_name="true" retain_ending_value="true" uid="34" x="768" y="590">
                <entity name="Survival_Win" />
